1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,370
(Bernadette:)Count your blessings

2
00:00:01,370 --> 00:00:03,540
(Bernadette:)you're not a Tanzanian chimp.

3
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:05,700
(Policeman:)What?

4
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:06,660
(Penny:)Don't listen to her--

5
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,570
(Penny:)she's had a lot
of ice cream.

6
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,510
(Penny:)Do you want to join us?

7
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:13,180
(Priya:)Oh, thank you,
but I have work to do.

8
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,750
(Amy:)Four women walk
down the stairs--

9
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:20,340
(Amy:)how many reach the lobby?

10
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:27,970
(Leonard:)Did your sister say anything
when you got home last night?

11
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:30,320
(Raj:)Oh, no, don't put me
in the middle of this.

12
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,990
(Raj:)I'm not going to
be your go-between.

13
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:33,160
(Leonard:)Come on, help me out.

14
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,560
(Leonard:)Am I in trouble?

15
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:36,510
(sighs) There's no
reason to worry.

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:37,660
(Leonard:)That's a relief.

17
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:38,860
(Raj:)I'm sure
many women

18
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,800
(Raj:)in happy relationships
spend their nights

19
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:43,200
(Raj:)Skyping with their
ex-boyfriend Sanjay.

20
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:48,770
(Howard:)Good news, gentlemen--
I found our hacker.

21
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:50,110
(Todd:)- What?
- Really?

22
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:51,970
(Howard:)Yeah. No one can hide from me,

23
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:53,660
(Howard:)not Waldo, not Carmen San Diego,

24
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:55,880
(Howard:)not even topless
Natalie Portman.

25
00:00:56,910 --> 00:00:58,720
(Sheldon:)I've never said
these words before,

